# This project intentionally commits its raw dataset (see data/README.md
# "Why this file is committed" section): winequality-red.csv is ~84 KB, a
# small public benchmark dataset, well under the 5 MB repository-safety
# threshold. The root .gitignore's blanket `**/data/**/*.csv` rule would
# otherwise silently exclude it, so it is explicitly re-included here.
!data/winequality-red.csv

# Everything else follows the normal repository conventions (no local
# environments, caches, or generated artifacts).
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
